** 0.a. Cholesky method checks

Macros live in $T2KOSCANA/macros/misc/cholesky/

Test that the covariance matrix calculated from N generated deviates agrees with the input covariance matrix:
test_cholesky_output_covariance.C

Test Cholesky decomposition of the SK CCQE ring-counting efficiency covariance matrix:
test_cholesky_decomp_sk_ccqe_rc_covariance.C

Test Cholesky decomposition of the BANFF covariance matrix:
test_cholesky_decomp_banff_covariance.C

Test generation of BANFF deviates using the Cholesky method:
test_banff_correlated_values_generated_from_an_uncorrelated_vector.C

Test that the covariance matrix calculated from N generated BANFF deviates agrees with the input BANFF covariance matrix:
test_cholesky_banff_output_covariance.C


** 0.b.  Oscillation probability calculation checks

Macros live in $T2KOSCANA/macros/misc/osc/

Test unitarity of PMNS mixing matrix:
check_pmns_unitarity.C

Plot 3-flavour oscillation probabilities:
plot_3f_osc_prob.C

Make plots of 2-flavour numu survival osc probability and range of 3-flavour probability varying non-23 sector parameters:
plot_numu_surv_prob_2f_vs_3frange.C

Make plots of 2-flavour numu survival oscillation probability and numu survival probability from decay and decoherence models:
plot_numu_surv_prob_var_hypotheses.C

Make plots of P(numu->nue) against P(numubar->nuebar) for T2K and NOvA and P(numu->nue) 
for T2K against P(numu->nue) for NOvA:
plot_deltacp_hierarchy_comp_t2k_nova.C

Generate tables with osc probabilites to check against tables generated by other codes:
osc_prob_tables_generate.C

Compare oscillation probability tables from various codes:
osc_prob_tables_compare.C

Code to plot non-maximal theta23 discovery potential in 
$T2KOSCANA/macros/misc/osc/non_maximal_theta23/


** 0.c.  Other

Comparing 1-D histograms.
If you have 2 files that contain some histograms that have the same name (compare_str has to be contained in the histogram 
name; can be "" if you want to compare all histograms), then this macro will divide the 2 (if they're not identical) & 
draw the comparison. Can also save to pdf. To compare quickly, use -b:
root2k -l '$T2KOSCANA/macros/misc/compare/compare_1dhist_all.C("/path/to/file1.root","path/to/file2.root","compare_str")'


